      "groupIds": [],
      "index": "b1R",
      "isDeleted": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "opacity": 100,
      "originalText": "Outbox rows → Debezium CDC\n→ Kafka topics:\n\nproducts.created\n  → Search + Inventory\n\ncheckout.*.v1 commands\n  → Orders, Inventory, Payment\n\ncheckout.*.v1 results\n  → Checkout inbox\n\nConsumers: inbox + idempotent\nwrites; no cross-service tx.\n\n(4) publish serves both the\ncatalog and saga flows.",
      "roughness": 0,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 471222547,
      "strokeColor": "#874b1a",
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "text": "Outbox rows → Debezium CDC\n→ Kafka topics:\n\nproducts.created\n  → Search + Inventory\n\ncheckout.*.v1 commands\n  → Orders, Inventory, Payment\n\ncheckout.*.v1 results\n  → Checkout inbox\n\nConsumers: inbox + idempotent\nwrites; no cross-service tx.\n\n(4) publish serves both the\ncatalog and saga flows.",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "updated": 1790786597314,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 365031473,
      "verticalAlign": "top"
    },
